- the array $$$[1, 2, 2, 2, 2]$$$ is beautiful: for $$$a_1$$$, the condition $$$a_1 = 1$$$ holds; for every other number $$$a_i$$$, the number $$$a_i - 1 = 1$$$ exists in the array;

